{#
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  QUICK SETTINGS — what the phone app bar's avatar opens
  REFERENCE §7.2 · design/AppBar.dc.html (its `qs` state) · skill §3
  ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

  In §7.2's order: the profile row and its Profile link · text size (a 3-step segmented
  control, 48px) · High contrast and Reduce motion · the languages as chips, each written
  in its own language with `lang`, scrolling sideways · "All display & reading settings"
  · a 52px Done. It exists so the phone bar holds ONE button instead of three — the Aa
  and the globe live here (§18.5).

  ── A SUBSET OF ONE STORE, NOT A SECOND STORE ──────────────────────────────

  Two of the seven switches and the size, writing the same `ag-a11y` store through
  `AGA11y.set()`; the other five are one tap away in the Menu's sub-view, which is the
  shared `display-reading.twig`. DisplayReadingTest holds that this file offers no key the
  store does not know.

  ── THE CHIPS SCROLL, AND THAT IS A DECISION ───────────────────────────────

  Eight chips do not fit across 390px. A horizontal scroller is acceptable for a shortcut
  and never as the only way to an option, which is why the Menu's Language sub-view lists
  the same eight vertically. They are LINKS (the middleware stores the choice), so they
  work with scripting off.

  The DC draws this sheet's state and not its markup, so the parts are the base
  components at the DC's values: the segmented control at §7.2's 48, the switch rows at
  DisplayReading's, the chips at the AppBar DC's borders (2px ink chosen, 1px line-2).
#}
{% set _ini = member_name ? (member_name|split(' ')|filter(w => w != '')|map(w => w|first)|join|upper|slice(0, 2)) : 'AG' %}
<div class="ag-scrim" data-ag-quick-scrim></div>

<div class="ag-sheet ag-qs" id="ag-quick" data-ag-quick-sheet role="dialog" aria-modal="true"
     aria-label="{{ 'Account, language and display'|trans }}" inert>

  <span class="ag-sheet__grabber" aria-hidden="true"></span>

  <div class="ag-qs__body">
    {% if is_member %}
      <a class="ag-qs__me" href="/account">
        <span class="ag-menu__av ag-qs__av" aria-hidden="true">{{ _ini }}</span>
        <span class="ag-menu__who">
          <b class="ag-qs__name">{{ member_name|default('Your account'|trans) }}</b>
          <span class="ag-qs__sub">{{ 'Profile'|trans }}</span>
        </span>
        <span class="ag-list__chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
      </a>
    {% else %}
      <a class="ag-qs__me" href="/account/login">
        <span class="ag-menu__av ag-qs__av" aria-hidden="true">{{ _ini }}</span>
        <span class="ag-menu__who">
          <b class="ag-qs__name">{{ 'Sign in or join'|trans }}</b>
          <span class="ag-qs__sub">{{ 'Nominate, vote and keep your recognitions in one place.'|trans }}</span>
        </span>
        <span class="ag-list__chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
      </a>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ag-qs__block">
      <span class="ag-qs__h" id="ag-qs-size">{{ 'Text size'|trans }}</span>
      <div class="ag-seg ag-qs__seg" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="ag-qs-size">
        {% for s in [{i:0, name:'Standard text'}, {i:1, name:'Large text'}, {i:2, name:'Largest text'}] %}
          <button type="button" class="ag-seg__opt ag-dr__size ag-dr__size--{{ s.i }}" role="radio"
                  aria-checked="{{ s.i == 0 ? 'true' : 'false' }}" tabindex="{{ s.i == 0 ? '0' : '-1' }}"
                  aria-label="{{ s.name|trans }}" data-ag-size="{{ s.i }}">A</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="ag-qs__switches">
      {% for t in [
        {k:'hc',     label:'High contrast', help:'Darker text and borders'},
        {k:'motion', label:'Reduce motion', help:'No animation or auto-play'}
      ] %}
        <button type="button" class="ag-dr__row" role="switch" aria-checked="false" data-ag-toggle="{{ t.k }}">
          <span class="ag-dr__text">
            <span class="ag-dr__label">{{ t.label|trans }}</span>
            <span class="ag-dr__help">{{ t.help|trans }}</span>
          </span>
          <span class="ag-switch ag-dr__switch" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="ag-qs__block">
      <span class="ag-qs__h" id="ag-qs-lang">{{ 'Language'|trans }}</span>
      <nav class="ag-qs__langs" aria-labelledby="ag-qs-lang">
        {% for l in languages() %}
          <a class="ag-chip ag-qs__lang" href="{{ lang_url(l.code) }}" hreflang="{{ l.code }}" lang="{{ l.code }}" dir="{{ l.dir }}"
             {% if l.code == lang() %}aria-current="true"{% endif %}>{{ l.name }}</a>
        {% endfor %}
      </nav>
    </div>

    <button type="button" class="ag-list__row ag-qs__all" data-ag-quick-all>
      <span class="ag-list__label">{{ 'All display & reading settings'|trans }}</span>
      <span class="ag-list__chev" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="ag-ico-dir" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="m9 6 6 6-6 6"></path></svg></span>
    </button>

    {# "Done", not a cross: nothing here is destructive and nothing needs cancelling, so
       the one button says what pressing it means. #}
    <button type="button" class="ag-qs__done" data-ag-quick-close>{{ 'Done'|trans }}</button>
  </div>
</div>
